{"id": "sheriff-oversight-title-in-personal-encounters", "title": "Inspector General found a sheriff oversight official used his title for personal gain", "seconds": 44.8, "voice": "elevenlabs:iPYqcpY8j8Ap4jUf28I3", "narrator": "Michael", "made": "2026-11-25", "key": "899a6a442d463528", "words": 103, "beats": [{"scene": "open", "kind": "hook", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "During a traffic stop, William Palmer invoked his position on the Sheriff’s Department Oversight Board.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 5.77, "shot": "r0", "visual": {"type": "hook", "words": ["An", "oversight", "title", "at", "a", "traffic", "stop"], "sub": "Inspector General report"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.29, 0.36, 0.75, 1.49, 1.96, 2.41, 2.8, 2.95, 3.42, 3.52, 3.65, 4.07, 4.59, 5.17]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The Inspector General found he sought intervention from an accountability official.", "t0": 5.89, "t1": 10.02, "shot": "r1", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "ig", "kicker": "sf-inspector-general", "text": "December 2025 traffic stop", "mark": "December 2025 traffic stop"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.7, 1.11, 1.42, 1.57, 1.93, 2.63, 2.84, 2.92, 3.64]}, {"scene": "report", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The Inspector General substantiated six instances of misconduct.", "t0": 10.24, "t1": 14.45, "shot": "r2", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "6", "label": "Instances of misconduct substantiated"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.77, 1.18, 2.13, 2.59, 3.35, 3.48]}, {"scene": "report", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["established[1]"], "text": "The report covered contacts with police, hospital staff, prosecutors and the press.", "t0": 14.57, "t1": 20.6, "shot": "r3", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "ig", "kicker": "sf-inspector-general", "text": "Inspector General report", "mark": "Inspector General report"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.56, 0.9, 1.44, 1.63, 2.62, 3.16, 4.09, 5.1, 5.32, 5.42]}, {"scene": "report", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["established[1]", "defense[0]"], "text": "Palmer said he was acting in an oversight capacity. The report considered his account.", "t0": 20.72, "t1": 25.99, "shot": "r4", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Oversight capacity"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.47, 0.91, 1.08, 1.27, 1.65, 1.77, 1.91, 2.45, 3.48, 3.68, 4.12, 4.64, 4.78]}, {"scene": "proceeding", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "On September 29, the Board suspended Palmer and referred administrative charges.", "t0": 26.21, "t1": 31.67, "shot": "r5", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "motion", "kicker": "San Francisco Board of Supervisors", "text": "September 29 suspension", "mark": "September 29 suspension"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.63, 1.79, 1.95, 2.35, 2.94, 3.43, 3.66, 4.15, 4.86]}, {"scene": "proceeding", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["established[2]"], "text": "The Ethics Commission took up the proceeding.", "t0": 31.79, "t1": 34.02, "shot": "r6", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "charges", "kicker": "San Francisco Board of Supervisors", "text": "Administrative charges", "mark": "Administrative charges"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.18, 0.58, 1.09, 1.33, 1.5, 1.62]}, {"scene": "proceeding", "kind": "record", "ref": ["established[2]", "timeline[1]", "timeline[2]", "timeline[3]"], "text": "On November 13, the commission postponed preliminary matters.", "t0": 34.14, "t1": 38.43, "shot": "r7", "visual": {"type": "record", "layout": "timeline", "context": "Administrative proceeding", "heading": "Investigation and referral", "source": "ethics", "rows": [{"icon": "audit", "label": "Inspector General report", "event": "2026-09-11"}, {"icon": "vote", "label": "Board suspension", "event": "2026-09-29"}, {"icon": "calendar", "label": "Preliminary matters postponed", "event": "2026-11-13"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.53, 1.68, 1.84, 2.35, 3.18, 3.79]}, {"scene": "proceeding", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["notEstablished[0]", "next[0]"], "text": "The final outcome of the proceeding remains open.", "t0": 38.55, "t1": 41.18, "shot": "r8", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["Commission recommendation", "Final Board disposition"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.53, 0.94, 1.04, 1.15, 1.7, 2.18]}, {"scene": "proceeding", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 41.3, "t1": 43.93, "shot": "r9", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.46, 0.92, 1.11, 1.41, 1.49, 1.6, 1.86, 2.17]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"open": "The traffic stop", "report": "The investigation", "proceeding": "Suspension and referral"}, "look": "midnight", "hook": "person"}